<title>UK: Cassa di Risparmio Bologna sets 300 bln lire FRN.</title>
<headline>Cassa di Risparmio Bologna sets 300 bln lire FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers IMI Sigeco and EPTA.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CASSA DI RISPARMIO IN BOLOGNA</p>
<p> AMT    300 BLN LIRE  BASE	 6M-RIBOR  MATURITY    12.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  PAR	 DENOMS(M)  5	   LISTING MILAN</p>
<p> GOV LAW    MILAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
